{"id":"faculty-maifuz_ali:e0012","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Dr. Maifuz Ali is an Assistant Professor in the Electronics and Communication Engineering discipline. Prior to joining IIIT-NR, he has been associated as a researcher with Florida International University (FIU), Miami, USA; University of Central Florida (UCF), Orlando, USA; Tokyo Institute of Technology, Tokyo, Japan and Korea Advanced Institute of Science and Technology (KAIST), Republic of Korea. Dr. Ali received his Ph.D. in Electronics & Electrical Communication Engineering, Indian Institute of Technology, Kharagpur, India.\nHe has been an active member of the Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers (IEEE), USA and Institute of Electronics, Information and Communication Engineers (IEICE), Japan.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
